{"id":"vod_sn_36937","vodId":"36937","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"猫眼三姐妹第一季","name_cn":"猫眼三姐妹第一季","date":"1983-01-01","year":"1983","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/b39e3c850361994ca881dfe3dcdb5eee.jpg"},"summary":"来生三姐妹经营着一家名叫“猫眼”的咖啡店。其实，三姐妹是海恩茨的女儿，这位伟大的画家与收藏家，在三姐妹小时神秘失踪了，而随着父亲的失踪，家中的藏品也都一夜蒸发。于是，三姐妹白天是活泼可爱的少女，夜里变身成黑夜中的盗贼——“猫眼三姐妹”。她们只偷那些曾经是父亲的藏品，希望借此寻找到失踪的父亲的蛛丝马迹。而二妹来生瞳更是特殊，因为她的男友正是要逮捕“猫眼三姐妹”的年轻警察。真相与爱，黑夜中游走的三姐妹在一次次犯罪中找寻这些问题的答案。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":73,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JK1YZEHvaB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/sdFvUageVM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GnW2T4zG1t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Q3QrA35C561/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KnPV9sM7Mr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/kLqWUCpJzU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CcZKWkeY4j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tZBdYW1LfW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/uzEVSS3EPw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wdzeVZ00MN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mum47iyP8z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1tcKedBgNh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1m4A2CPUQe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WANgvB9tS31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HD9PvsJRtr1/video/index.